      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Currently layer count is MASSIVELY inflated in some editor tools (I have 10 layers but it reports 40), so this should probably not count those 20-30 layers that the VRC standard locomotion controller and other standard base parts add (somehow). Setting the threshold too low risks diluting the utility of the ranking system as a meaningful filter by casting too broad of a net (we’ve seen this before, and ratings *still* show in game as worse than they actually are at build). This warrants research and should absolutely be set completely differently for different platforms obviously.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
